  "miitDescription": "Myanmar Institute of Information Technology (MIIT) was established in 2015 as a National Centre of Excellence under the Ministry of Science & Technology in Myanmar. It resulted from a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between the governments of Myanmar and India, signed in May 2012, designed to model the institute after India's International Institute of Information Technology, Bangalore (IIIT-B).MIIT is situated in Chanmyathazi Township, Mandalay, at the corner of 73rd Street and Ngu Shwe Wah Street. MIIT offers two undergraduate degree programmes:\nB.E. (Honours) in Computer Science & Engineering (CSE) and B.E. (Honours) in Electronics & Communication Engineering (ECE).",
